      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → fal → fal Settings**.\n2. In **Script**, write what the host says after `\"text\":`, inside the quotation marks.\n3. In **Sound**, describe the background sound the same way.\n4. Press **Run**. The voice, the background, and the two mixed are saved under `audio/fal`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
