      "widgets_values": [
        "ElevenLabs v4 reads the script aloud. **Script** holds its `arguments`, the model's own settings by fal's names: ElevenLabs takes its words as `text`, not `prompt`. Add `\"voice\"` with another ElevenLabs voice name to change the voice; **Model: Info** lists every setting it takes."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
